    case SCon{Chr{U32{WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, +w}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}, +t}:
      top_step(Chr{U32{WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, w}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}, t, Char.is_eq(Chr{U32{WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{False{}, WCon{True{}, w}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}, '/'), bodies)
